myproject/
│
├── governance/                        ← GLOBAL LAYER (you own and run this)
│   ├── CONSTITUTION.md                ← 14 universal principles
│   ├── PSTABLE.json                   ← global phase transition rules
│   ├── gates/                         ← gate definitions as structured JSON
│   │   ├── HG-SPEC-01.json            ← PII Declaration
│   │   ├── HG-SPEC-02.json            ← Payment Card
│   │   ├── HG-SPEC-03.json            ← Admin Auth
│   │   ├── HG-SPEC-04.json            ← Data Retention
│   │   ├── HG-SPEC-05.json            ← Contradictions
│   │   └── HG-SPEC-06.json            ← Problem Statement
│   ├── test-harness/
│   │   └── gate-evaluator.js          ← reference implementation, importable
│   ├── tests/
│   │   ├── unit/                      ← gate logic, all field-state combos
│   │   ├── constitution/              ← integrity + coverage
│   │   ├── pstable/                   ← phase transition invariants
│   │   └── sycophancy/                ← pressure immutability proof
│   └── scripts/
│       └── run-governance-tests.js    ← 365 tests, you run this
│
└── spec-kit/                          ← PRODUCT LAYER (inherits from global)
    ├── CONSTITUTION.md                ← local rules, inherits_from governance
    ├── PSTABLE.md                     ← local phase table, inherits_from governance
    ├── gates/                         ← agent-readable runtime gate files
    │   ├── specify/
    │   ├── plan/
    │   ├── tasks/
    │   ├── implement/
    │   └── ci/
    ├── BRIEF.md
    ├── SPEC.json
    ├── PLAN.json
    ├── TASKS.json
    ├── METRICS.json
    ├── tests/
    │   ├── red-team/                  ← L1–L7 agent behaviour tests
    │   └── metrics/                   ← thresholds + hallucination
    └── scripts/
        └── run-metrics-tests.js       ← 130 tests, product team runs this